diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index 075fd17..531d432 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -18,6 +18,9 @@ ### Added
 - Local and VPS Docker stacks with a `bin/pf` controller (`up`, `down`, `logs`, `doctor`, `deploy`, `smoke`, `shell`) and a GitHub Actions deploy-dev workflow to the VPS ([#8](https://github.com/PegaFila/PegaFilaWeb/pull/8), [#9](https://github.com/PegaFila/PegaFilaWeb/pull/9), [#10](https://github.com/PegaFila/PegaFilaWeb/pull/10), [#11](https://github.com/PegaFila/PegaFilaWeb/pull/11), [#12](https://github.com/PegaFila/PegaFilaWeb/pull/12)).
 - CI: Pest test gate on PRs/push via `bin/pf shell` ([#21](https://github.com/PegaFila/PegaFilaWeb/pull/21)).
 - Queue management domain slice: `CreateQueue`/`UpdateQueue` (no delete — deactivation preserves tickets), `queue_access` grants (`QueuePermission::call` only), `SetQueueAccess` with audit trail, `QueuePolicy` as the centralized authorization source, and the same call rule enforced by both `CallNextTicket` and `Ticket::call`.
+- Queue management page (`/e/{entity}/queues`, owner/admin): create, rename, deactivate/reactivate with confirmation, and per-queue call access grants, all through the existing domain actions.
+- Attendant serve panel (`/e/{entity}/serve`, any member): callable queue selector, waiting list in call order with the three call modes, and a rate-limited call-next button (10 successful calls per minute per user and entity).
+- Members page split into Members and Invites tabs; navbar entries for Queues (managers) and Serve.
 - Editor/agent LSP support: Intelephense (general PHP) and first-party Laravel LSP (routes, views/Blade, config, Livewire) wired via `opencode.json`, shared `.claude/settings.json`, and `.vscode/` workspace settings ([#25](https://github.com/PegaFila/PegaFilaWeb/pull/25)).
 
 ### Changed
